  "Q00002_WhatWomenWant/30146-01.html": {
   "file": "Q00002_WhatWomenWant/30146-01.html",
   "quest": 2,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Mirabel: Again!? Sigh... Every year around this time, some poor soul always seems to fall head-over-heels for sister. But what does any of this have to do with me? I have no idea what my sister thinks of Arujien or anyone else; from what I can tell, her heart has never been warmed by tho…",
   "header": "Gatekeeper Mirabel",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 1"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00002_WhatWomenWant/30146-02.html": {
   "file": "Q00002_WhatWomenWant/30146-02.html",
   "quest": 2,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Mirabel: Stop bothering me with this foolishness! I warn you: I'm this close to sending you somewhere where you'll never bother anyone ever again! If you want insights into my sister's romantic life, go pester my uncle, Trader Herbiel.",
   "header": "Gatekeeper Mirabel",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00007_ATripBegins/30146-01.htm": {
   "file": "Q00007_ATripBegins/30146-01.htm",
   "quest": 7,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Mirabel: As much as I've traveled, even I can't claim to understand all the peoples in this wide world. Our Elven Forest is a peaceful haven, but the outside world also has much to offer -- especially a bustling place like Giran. Only through interacting with outsiders can we better unde…",
   "header": "Gatekeeper Mirabel",
   "when": [
    "state CREATED; ((player.getRace() == Race.ELF) && (player.getLevel() >= MIN_LEVEL))"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"I want to see the world!\"",
