   "file": "Q00007_ATripBegins/30146-02.html",
   "quest": 7,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Mirabel: As much as I've traveled, even I can't claim to understand all the peoples in this wide world. Our Elven Forest is a peaceful haven, but the outside world also has much to offer -- especially a bustling place like Giran. Perhaps one day you will be able to see it for yourself! (…",
