  "Q00007_ATripBegins/30146-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00007_ATripBegins/30146-03.htm",
   "quest": 7,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Mirabel: Don't be foolish! You have no idea where you should go! Experience is an excellent teacher, but she is also a harsh one. It will not be easy for you venture out from the protective shade of the World Tree. If you are really serious about traveling to the outside world, ask a mor…",
