  "Q00007_ATripBegins/30146-06.html": {
   "file": "Q00007_ATripBegins/30146-06.html",
   "quest": 7,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Mirabel: Very well. Here is a Scroll of Escape to the Town of Giran as well a Traveler's Mark . The Scroll can only be used once, remember! When you are ready to return to the Elven Village, visit Trader Galladucci and show him the Traveler's Mark. A word of warning: Giran is a crowded a…",
   "header": "Gatekeeper Mirabel",
   "sets": {
    "reward": true
   },
   "outcome": "reward",
   "links": []
